---
import CareerBar from "./CareerBar.astro";
---

<section id="top" class="relative">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 pb-10 pt-10 sm:px-8 sm:pb-14 sm:pt-14">
    <h1 class="max-w-3xl text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#0b0b0b] sm:text-5xl">
      I design and build visualization software to help people make sense of data.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg text-[#52514e]">
      I work across engineering, design, and data science to expose meaningful patterns in data. I <a href="#software" class="font-medium text-[#be185d] hover:underline">release software</a> that facilitates data analysis, work collaboratively to <a href="#dataviz" class="font-medium text-[#be185d] hover:underline">create visualizations</a>, and also <a href="#teaching" class="font-medium text-[#be185d] hover:underline">teach</a> these skills in University and professional environments. I'm drawn towards projects about social issues, and have an extensive background in public health.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-6 text-[#52514e]">Here's a quick overview of what I've been up to:</p>
    <CareerBar />
  </div>
</section>
